sign</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">. The FastAPI backend ensures modular, secure routing and robust session handling, while the Jinja2-powered frontend offers an intuitive and clean interface for users to interact with the system in real time.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;line-height:1.0;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Each moduleâ€”from registration to recommendationsâ€”is designed to simplify decision-making and enhance the shopping or planning experience through automation and personalization. Whether itâ€™s finding the right wall art within budget or organizing a last-minute party, PocketSmart AI acts as a </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">smart digital assistant</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, saving time and effort while optimizing outcomes.With its seamless fusion of generative AI and web technologies, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">PocketSmart AI</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">stands as a practical example of how </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">AI can enhance everyday decision-making</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, bringing intelligent recommendations to users' fingertipsâ€”budget-friendly, fast, and personalized</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">.</span></p><p style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:14pt;line-height:1.0;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-